[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16620.551, "timestamp": "04:37:00", "text": "是你的同代人，对吧？所以诸如此类的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16622.709, "timestamp": "04:37:02", "text": "呃，会有很多呃的例子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16625.67, "timestamp": "04:37:05", "text": "你会看到这样的评论："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16627.59, "timestamp": "04:37:07", "text": "人们会将你与其他世代进行比较"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16628.452, "timestamp": "04:37:08", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I need to address it right? I need to confront them right? "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16629.99, "timestamp": "04:37:09", "text": "朋友之类的，对吧？他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16632.31, "timestamp": "04:37:12", "text": "还提到了其他相关话题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16635.75, "timestamp": "04:37:15", "text": "东西。所以你要做的就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16638.59, "timestamp": "04:37:18", "text": "拥有权力和自由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16642.551, "timestamp": "04:37:22", "text": "拥有妥善处理此事的自由。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16646.91, "timestamp": "04:37:26", "text": "告诉他们，嘿，这是我的频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16648.91, "timestamp": "04:37:28", "text": "规则和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16651.51, "timestamp": "04:37:31", "text": "比如不要提起其他事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16654.709, "timestamp": "04:37:34", "text": "除非我事先提到，否则都是 YouTuber。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16657.109, "timestamp": "04:37:37", "text": "所有这些都足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16660.551, "timestamp": "04:37:40", "text": "你可以告诉他们一些事情，还可以做一些事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16663.83, "timestamp": "04:37:43", "text": "他们做得很好，呃，别拿我跟他们比。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16666.709, "timestamp": "04:37:46", "text": "比如你在开玩笑什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16669.67, "timestamp": "04:37:49", "text": "就像……开玩笑什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16672.709, "timestamp": "04:37:52", "text": "进入一个，该怎么